# Environment
.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Photos. Currently 126 MB and growing ~25 MB/day at a 3-minute interval --
# far past what belongs in a repo. Everything they contain has already been
# extracted into data/readings.db, which IS tracked.
captures/

# SQLite side files: transient, machine-local, and never safe to commit.
# readings.db-wal in particular is a partial log, not a database.
data/readings.db-wal
data/readings.db-shm
data/process.lock

# Derived. Regenerate any time with analyze.py / advise.py / readings.py --csv.
data/reports/

# Tracked deliberately: data/night_labels.json is your own notes on what each
# night's experiment changed, not something the program can regenerate.

# Deliberately NOT ignored: data/readings.db -- the readings themselves,
# ~85 KB today and about 25 MB per year.
